WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.860
On the battlements, the watch
talk of a threat from outside:

2
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.270
an army being raised abroad.

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:11.580
Inside the castle, dark spots spread
from room to room, like mould.

4
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:15.500
And behind every curtain
and door, an eye opens.

5
00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:21.700
Marcellus, on watch, puts it plainly:
"Something is rotten in the state of Denmark."

6
00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.870
But where does the rot start?

7
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.950
In this mission, you'll
follow a cluster of images,

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.500
disease, poison and decay,
starting with "an unweeded garden".

9
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:38.250
You'll map a court of watchers, where people
hide behind the arras, "seeing unseen".

10
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.630
And you'll ask who should wear the crown,

11
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.810
in a play written as old
Elizabeth I had named no heir.

12
00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.060
Your mission: find out
where the rot starts.
